            <ArticleTitle>Access To Contraceptives Top Women's Health Issue.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>26-27</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>When asked to rank the top five most important issues in women's health, 40% of respondents ranked access to contraceptives as the number one issue, 31% ranked access to abortion services, and 28%, cancer screening. Seventy-eight percent thought that healthy aging will be the most important issue in three to five years.</AbstractText>
